WEBVTT

00:05:28.855 --> 00:05:32.662
Ayni shu tadqiqotda aytilishicha, 
tabassum qilish hisobingizga 16.000 funt

00:05:32.686 --> 00:05:36.792
sterling naqd pul qabul qilganingizda his 
etiladigan hissiyotni uyg'otadi.

00:05:36.816 --> 00:05:37.817
(Kulgu)

00:05:37.841 --> 00:05:39.686
Bu degani bir dona tabassum 25 funt.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:40.861
Chakki emas.

00:05:41.443 --> 00:05:42.888
Boshqacharoq o'ylab ko'ring:

00:05:42.912 --> 00:05:45.601
400ni 25,000 martaga oshirsak --

00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:49.046
anchagina bolalar o’zini har kuni
Mark Zukerberg kabi his qilishyapti.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.815
(Kulgu)

00:05:50.839 --> 00:05:52.428
Bir quloch shokoloddan farqli,

00:05:52.452 --> 00:05:54.737
bir quloch tabassum bilan 
sog’lomroq bo'lasiz.

00:05:55.198 --> 00:05:59.045
Jilmayish stressni 
faollashtiruvchi gormonlardan kortizol,

00:05:59.069 --> 00:06:02.250
adrenalin va dofaminni kamaytirib,